1
00:00:04,359 --> 00:00:08,821
Whoa hey, Earth!
I brought you here as my friend—

2
00:00:08,821 --> 00:00:11,444
—not for you to come drink like this!

3
00:00:11,444 --> 00:00:13,039
Give me the glass back.

4
00:00:13,468 --> 00:00:14,371
You're hurting me.

5
00:00:14,519 --> 00:00:15,390
Let go.

6
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,240
Hey—
Earth, you idiot!

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,615
What?

8
00:00:23,615 --> 00:00:25,926
Where'd you get this energy from?

9
00:00:25,926 --> 00:00:27,916
Do you even know how expensive
the drinks are here?

10
00:00:27,916 --> 00:00:29,166
So what?

11
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:33,920
I can pay.
Who said I'd pay?

12
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,609
You invited me, so you should treat me.

13
00:00:37,609 --> 00:00:39,996
Are you even listening to me?

14
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,840
I know.
I know that—

15
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,640
—since you invited me, you're responsible.

16
00:00:46,306 --> 00:00:49,674
Dude, I invited you to sit with me!

17
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:53,255
Not to burn through money!
Yeah yeah…

18
00:01:00,879 --> 00:01:03,000
P', one more please.

19
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:11,564
Hello, Earth? What's up—
Hello?

20
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:16,837
P'Gun, this is… this is Tawan.

21
00:01:17,814 --> 00:01:21,592
Oh, not Earth? Tawan, what's up?

22
00:01:22,051 --> 00:01:25,712
No, P'. It's me, Tawan.
Where are you right now?

23
00:01:25,712 --> 00:01:29,754
Come pick him up fast—
otherwise he'll spend everything!

24
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:35,199
Huh? Find somewhere quiet to talk,
I can't hear you, Tawan.
